btw NOERR:
btw The main script never waits, and every task still runs after it ends, FIFO.
cook lateprint(tag) { yap tag }
cook napper() {
    nap(20)
    yap "napper done"
}
cook spawnsmore() {
    yap "spawner ran"
    sendit lateprint("spawned by a task")
}
sendit lateprint("a")
sendit lateprint("b")
sendit napper()
sendit spawnsmore()
yap "main done"
btw OUT: main done
btw OUT: a
btw OUT: b
btw OUT: spawner ran
btw OUT: spawned by a task
btw OUT: napper done
